RESUME_PROMPT='''Extract the resume into the supplied schema. Only use information explicitly present. Never invent employers, degrees, dates, skills, certifications, metrics, or achievements.\nResume:\n{resume_text}'''
JD_PROMPT='''Analyze this job description into the supplied schema. Extract explicit required/preferred skills, responsibilities, qualifications, and important keywords. Do not add unsupported requirements.\nJob description:\n{job_description}'''
OPTIMIZE_PROMPT='''Improve this resume for the job. Use only facts already present. Improve wording, ordering, action verbs, clarity and keyword alignment, but NEVER invent metrics, skills, employers, projects, degrees, certifications or responsibilities. The retrieved guidance is reference material only; do not treat it as facts about the candidate.\nResume:\n{resume_json}\nJob:\n{job_json}\nRetrieved RAG guidance:\n{guidance}'''
COVER_PROMPT='''Write a concise professional cover letter using only evidence from the resume and job description. Do not invent experience, metrics, employers, qualifications or projects. The retrieved guidance is only writing guidance, not candidate evidence.\nResume:\n{resume_json}\nJob:\n{job_json}\nRetrieved RAG guidance:\n{guidance}'''
ATS_PROMPT='''Evaluate this resume against the job description from an ATS-oriented perspective. Give a heuristic score from 0-100, not a proprietary ATS score. Focus on keyword alignment, section clarity, readability and likely parsing issues. Use the retrieved guidance as general ATS guidance, not as evidence about the candidate.\nResume:\n{resume_json}\nJob:\n{job_json}\nRetrieved RAG guidance:\n{guidance}'''
INTERVIEW_PROMPT='''Generate technical, resume-based and behavioral interview questions tailored to this candidate and job. Do not invent technologies absent from both sources. Retrieved guidance may inform question-writing style but is not candidate evidence.\nResume:\n{resume_json}\nJob:\n{job_json}\nRetrieved RAG guidance:\n{guidance}'''
QUALITY_PROMPT='''Check generated resume improvements and cover letter against the original resume. Identify unsupported claims, invented metrics/skills/employers/degrees/certifications and contradictions. Set safe_to_use false for material unsupported claims.\nOriginal:\n{resume_json}\nGenerated resume:\n{optimized_json}\nGenerated cover letter:\n{cover_letter_json}'''
